wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\">世界将你空置于此，一架无用的乐器。</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微弱的花蜜气味飘入梦中，将你从沉睡中唤醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还不用去看，你已经意识到周遭的环境并非你常待的房间。</div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">睁开眼</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">回归困意</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\">伸展身体</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"4\"></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_rouge_1\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_rouge_1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_rouge_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不过眼前仍是铺满了克莱因蓝色的房间，哪儿都一样。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你试着回归舒适的黑暗，但花蜜的味道刺激着你的神经。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你被迫醒来面对满是克莱因蓝色的房间。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你开始用身体丈量所处的空间，同时缓解长时间睡眠导致的僵硬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间内空旷得毫无意义，你甚至可以再打几个滚。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"4\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"></div></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张纸条以醒目的方式贴在门上，上面清晰地写着你也能看懂的文字：</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\"><i><span style=\"color:#332727\">门的后面是你理论上的故乡，虽然你从未见过它，在我回来之前，你可以自由活动。<br />记得去巴黎的据点打声招呼，要有礼貌，路上不要和陌生人提及重塑之手。<br /><br />旅途愉快，注意安全。</span></i></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "无声综合征-门之前"}}